# stray output of examples/pyfiles/paper_examples.py when it is run from the
# repository root: it falls back to ./figures when it cannot find the paper.
# Anchored, so that paper/figures/ --- the tracked artwork of the manuscript ---
# stays addable: an unanchored `figures/' matches at every level and makes git
# refuse to add a new figure to the paper.
/figures/

# per-machine Claude Code notes, not shared with contributors
CLAUDE.local.md

# LaTeX build products of the software paper. The sources (main.tex, the
# Makefile) and the figures are tracked; the PDFs are rebuilt with `make`.
paper/*.aux
paper/*.log
paper/*.out
paper/*.spl
paper/*.bbl
paper/*.blg
paper/*.fls
paper/*.fdb_latexmk
paper/*.run.xml
paper/*.synctex.gz
paper/pyvoa-softwarex.pdf
paper/pyvoa-softwarex-draft.pdf

# Sphinx build output
docs/_build/

# The SoftwareX guide for authors, kept in paper/ for reference while the
# manuscript is written. It is Elsevier copyright: read it, cite it, do not
# redistribute it from a public repository.
paper/Guide for authors*.pdf
